; Division rounds to Python's 28 significant digits: the balances hold every
; digit, which 16 decimal places would miss.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Third
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Seventh
2020-01-02 * "one third"
  Expenses:Third   1/3 USD
  Assets:Cash
2020-01-03 * "a seventh of a million"
  Expenses:Seventh   1000000/7 USD
  Assets:Cash
2020-01-04 balance Expenses:Third    0.3333333333333333333333333333 USD
2020-01-04 balance Expenses:Seventh  142857.1428571428571428571429 USD
